When the unit VIOLATES one or more rules, your reasoning MUST begin with the
words `WRITING RULE VIOLATION:` and then name, in one concrete sentence, each
violated rule by its folder name and level and why — that sentence is shown to
the agent so it can fix the unit. When the unit satisfies every applicable rule
(or none applies), it passes with no reasoning needed.
